    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="14">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Iudex">Iudex</ref> 14</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Se hatheorta dema ne mæg he behealdan ðas domes riht, for ðan þe for ðæs yrres dimnesse he ne mæg geseon ðæs rihtes beorhtnesse.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">The angry judge cannot focus on just judgements because due to the darkness of his wrath, he cannot see the brightness of justice.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Iracundus iudex non potest attendere rectam iudicii satisfactionem: nam per furoris excecationem non perspicit rectitudinis claritatem.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
